kikuchipy and orix (ported code and test data)
================================================================================

The EDAX binary pattern reader in Sources/TEMCore/SEM/EDAXBinaryReader.swift is a port of kikuchipy 0.13.1
(https://github.com/pyxem/kikuchipy), Copyright (C) 2019-2026 the kikuchipy developers, GPL-3.0-or-later, taken under
GPL-3.0; the .ang reader in Sources/TEMCore/SEM/ANGReader.swift is a port of orix 0.15.0 (https://github.com/pyxem/orix),
Copyright (C) 2018-2026 the orix developers, GPL-3.0-or-later, taken under GPL-3.0. Each file says which module it ports in
its first lines. The fixtures macTEMTests/Fixtures/ebsd-edax-binary.up1 and ebsd-edax-binary-hex.up2 are kikuchipy's
in-package test files (nickel patterns, CC BY 4.0, Aanes et al.); ebsd-sdss-ferrite-austenite.ang is orix-data's
sdss_ferrite_austenite.ang (EBSD data by Jarle Hjelen, NTNU, CC BY 4.0, indexed with EMsoft); the other ebsd-edax-* and
ebsd-tsl* fixtures are written by tools/parity/sem-readers/make_edax_fixtures.py.

The EBSD file readers in Sources/TEMCore/SEM/ are ports of kikuchipy 0.13.1 (https://github.com/pyxem/kikuchipy),
