PyEBSDIndex (NLPAR, derived and modified)
================================================================================

Sources/TEMCore/SEM/NLPAR.swift is derived from PyEBSDIndex 0.3.10.1 (https://github.com/USNavalResearchLaboratory/PyEBSDIndex,
`pyebsdindex/nlpar_cpu.py`), developed by employees of the US Naval Research Laboratory (NRL), an agency of the Federal
Government, and not subject to copyright protection in the United States (17 U.S.C. § 105); where NRL may hold copyright
elsewhere it grants the right to prepare and distribute derivative works. This derived work acknowledges the US Naval
Research Laboratory as the original source. Modified 2026-11-06: ported to Swift (in memory rather than through pattern
files, tile budget fixed at pyebsdindex's 32e9-byte cap, a search window larger than the scan refused). Its one-dimensional
Nelder–Mead minimiser follows SciPy 1.18.1's `_minimize_neldermead` (BSD-3-Clause, Copyright (c) 2001-2002 Enthought, Inc.
and 2003-2026 SciPy Developers).

